# Local environment variables for the Claude Review Upload page.
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) if you really need build-time values.

# WARNING: every VITE_* value is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
# A GitHub token placed here is readable by anyone who opens the deployed site
# (DevTools → Sources), even if it never appears in the UI.
# Leave this commented out and use the "Connect" button on /claude-review-upload
# instead: it stores the token in the browser only.
# VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
